          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Gloria Steinem's Early Life</strong><br>\nGloria Steinem was born on March 25, 1934, in Toledo, Ohio. As a child, she traveled across the country with her family, which influenced her perspective on social issues. Despite facing financial instability and her parents' divorce, Steinem excelled in school. She later attended Smith College, where she studied government and politics. Steinem's early experiences with inequality and her mother's struggles with mental health shaped her advocacy for women's rights.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Launch of a Journalist</strong><br>\nAfter college, Steinem gained recognition as a journalist in New York City. She wrote for various publications, tackling social and political issues. In 1963, she gained national attention with her two-part series \"A Bunny's Tale,\" where she went undercover as a Playboy Bunny to expose the sexist treatment of women at Playboy Clubs. This bold move established her as a fierce critic of gender discrimination.</p>\n\n<p><strong>A Voice for Women's Liberation</strong><br>\nSteinem became an iconic figure in the Women's Liberation Movement during the late 1960s and early 1970s. She co-founded \"New York Magazine\" and was a columnist for the publication, using it as a platform to champion women's rights. Her advocacy centered on issues such as abortion rights, equal pay, and the eradication of gender roles. She helped popularize the feminist movement and brought it to the mainstream media's attention.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
