            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Recognition and Awards</strong><br>\nThroughout her career, Steinem has received numerous awards and honors for her work in feminism and journalism. She was inducted into the National Women's Hall of Fame and has received the Presidential Medal of Freedom. These accolades celebrate her lifelong commitment to fighting for gender equality and social justice.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Challenges and Controversies</strong><br>\nSteinem has often been at the center of controversy for her outspoken views. She has faced criticism and backlash from both opponents and factions within the feminist movement. However, she remains steadfast in her beliefs and continues to challenge societal norms and advocate for a more inclusive and equitable world.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Legacy and Influence</strong><br>\nGloria Steinem's influence on the feminist movement is undeniable. She has inspired generations of women to fight for their rights and has made significant contributions to the advancement of women's issues. Her legacy is that of a trailblazer who used her pen and voice to break barriers and change the course of history for women worldwide.</p>\n"
              },
